#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "That record belongs to a Cacti device you do not have permission for. Nothing was changed."
msgstr "Taj zapis pripada Cacti uređaju za koji nemate dozvolu. Ništa nije promijenjeno."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Name: another filesystem of this backend already uses this name."
msgstr "Naziv: drugi datotečni sistem ovog pozadinskog sistema već koristi ovaj naziv."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The filesystem could not be saved."
msgstr "Datotečni sistem nije moguće sačuvati."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The filesystem was saved."
msgstr "Datotečni sistem je sačuvan."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The filesystem, its nodes, and its inventory were deleted. Its Cacti device, data sources, and graphs were kept. No node was contacted."
msgstr "Datotečni sistem, njegovi čvorovi i inventar su obrisani. Njegov Cacti uređaj, izvori podataka i grafikoni su zadržani. Nijedan čvor nije kontaktiran."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Name: another node already uses this name."
msgstr "Naziv: drugi čvor već koristi ovaj naziv."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node could not be saved."
msgstr "Čvor nije moguće sačuvati."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node was saved."
msgstr "Čvor je sačuvan."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node was deleted. Targets it reported keep their history."
msgstr "Čvor je obrisan. Ciljevi koje je prijavio zadržavaju svoju historiju."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Enter a network as an address and prefix length, such as 10.20.0.0/16."
msgstr "Unesite mrežu kao adresu i dužinu prefiksa, na primjer 10.20.0.0/16."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "No device was added: the filesystem already has one, or the templates are not installed."
msgstr "Nijedan uređaj nije dodat: datotečni sistem ga već ima ili šabloni nisu instalirani."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device could not be mapped. It may be mapped to another filesystem."
msgstr "Uređaj nije moguće mapirati. Moguće je da je već mapiran na drugi datotečni sistem."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device was mapped and the data queries and overview graphs were added."
msgstr "Uređaj je mapiran, a upiti podataka i pregledni grafikoni su dodati."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Cacti did not create the device. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Cacti nije kreirao uređaj. Provjerite Cacti zapisnik."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device, its data queries, and its overview graphs were created."
msgstr "Uređaj, njegovi upiti podataka i pregledni grafikoni su kreirani."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device is no longer mapped. It and its graphs were kept; its data queries list no targets until it is mapped again."
msgstr "Uređaj više nije mapiran. Uređaj i njegovi grafikoni su zadržani; njegovi upiti podataka ne prikazuju ciljeve dok se ponovo ne mapira."

